			"Message": "docs(Rest): Annotate all Fn module items with rustdoc comments\n\nAdd module-level (`//!`) and item-level (`///`) documentation comments across the entire Source/Fn/ module tree — Binary, Build, Bundle, NLS, OXC, SWC, Transform, Worker, and the top-level Fn re-export module.\n\nEach public struct, impl block, pub fn, enum, and module now carries a brief rustdoc description of its purpose, following PascalCase naming and the project's documentation conventions.\n\nAll pre-existing module and sub-module declarations are preserved; no runtime behavior is affected. This improves IDE hover info, generated docs, and developer onboarding for the Rest JS bundler compilation pipeline.",
